      <span class="badge bg-primary-subtle text-primary border-0" style="font-size: 0.7rem;">DKIM 2048: PASS</span>
      <span class="badge bg-primary-subtle text-primary border-0" style="font-size: 0.7rem;">DMARC: PASS</span>
      <span class="badge bg-primary-subtle text-primary border-0" style="font-size: 0.7rem;">rDNS: PASS</span>
